                    {
                        "sense_id": "3c08f89d-0257-3c9c-96bf-fa8214993001",
                        "entry_id": "7c542d09-d814-3364-9b0a-9ccb45879048",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The name of the Latin-script letter V/v."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ab954c8d-f1e6-4c10-b256-c06f4e2a6cb9",
                                "sense_id": "3c08f89d-0257-3c9c-96bf-fa8214993001",
                                "text": "Gussa-Merry-Mingo-Pip-Perry-Pingo is the name of the little old man who looks after the aitch-oh-vee-ee-ar-cee-ay-ar-pee-ee-tee-blank-ar-eye-dee-ee-ess."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a6deaf9f-3ed6-41e9-a8e7-4ac96d005384",
                                "sense_id": "3c08f89d-0257-3c9c-96bf-fa8214993001",
                                "text": "RV [is spoken] as \"ar-vee\" instead of \"I SPELL Romeo Victor\"."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8d9c3b58-f21f-3439-9653-43a592d0d49c",
                        "entry_id": "7c542d09-d814-3364-9b0a-9ccb45879048",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Something with the shape of the letter V."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "33524dde-1f40-4b70-a008-eb1545aa90ae",
                                "sense_id": "8d9c3b58-f21f-3439-9653-43a592d0d49c",
                                "text": "One of [the men] took up both spaces on the pink sofa, while the other two drew up chairs from a nearby table and squeezed into them. The armrests were forced out into a tired vee, to the accompaniment of an uneasy creaking sound."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a1d95368-88bd-4a6c-ac3d-967b2ef157b3",
                                "sense_id": "8d9c3b58-f21f-3439-9653-43a592d0d49c",
                                "text": "The river leapt and rippled like a lizard. Geese flew over in a vee, crying to the sky."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0db1007a-1c32-4bba-972b-06e436566498",
                                "sense_id": "8d9c3b58-f21f-3439-9653-43a592d0d49c",
                                "text": "York's new railway offices are rather smart, tucked into the vee of York South Junction where the freight lines diverge to avoid the station."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a10a2c9d-edc0-3875-8ca0-a26508170df7",
                        "entry_id": "7c542d09-d814-3364-9b0a-9ccb45879048",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The arc of the field, forward of the batsman, from cover to midwicket, in which drives are played."
